sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Utilisateur
    participant R as React (Client public)
    participant K as Keycloak
    participant S as Spring Boot

    U->>R: ouvre http://localhost:5173
    R->>K: keycloak.init()<br/>redirection vers /auth (PKCE S256)
    K->>U: page de connexion
    U->>K: identifiants (alice / bob)
    K-->>R: code d'autorisation
    R->>K: POST /token (code + code_verifier)
    K-->>R: access_token + id_token + refresh_token
    R->>S: GET /api/demandes<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    S->>S: vérifie signature / iss / exp (JWKS)
    S-->>R: 200 OK (demandes JSON)
    R-->>U: affiche les demandes
